                    <a href="/acp/search-results?page=1&amp;tax=P292P6596">X-ray astronomy</a><span>,</span>
                    <a href="/acp/search-results?page=1&amp;tax=P4276C1894">X-ray optics</a><span>,</span>
                    <a href="/acp/search-results?page=1&amp;tax=P5510P3944">News and events</a>
